      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我緊張到話都要說不好了。\n所以麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117DCA5F3552308A7190FD89818AAA4E0D597D4E863002000A62404EE59EBB716900100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和她對話的時候，請幫幫我吧！\n拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C59795C0D8A71768466425019FF0C8ACB5E6B5E6B62115427FF01000A62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好了的話，請跟我說一聲。\n真的拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E8676848A71FF0C8ACB8DDF62118AAA4E0080723002000A771F768462DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E8620262026FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好\n要幫我了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D000A89815E6B62114E8655CEFF1F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "包在我身上！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5305572862118EAB4E0AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要當幫手的話，就請好好幫忙吧。\n我的心臟因為緊張快要爆炸了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898175765E6B624B76848A71FF0C5C318ACB597D597D5E6B5FD954273002000A621176845FC381DF56E070BA7DCA5F355FEB8981720670B84E862026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請……請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多指教。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB202620268ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3591A591A63076559300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她真的很喜歡扒手貓……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我也因此捕捉了扒手貓，\n但我剛捉到而已，對牠還不是很熟悉……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5979771F76845F88559C6B616252624B8C932026202600100001BE01000A62114E5F56E06B64635563494E866252624B8C93FF0C000A4F466211525B63495230800C5DF2FF0C5C0D726090844E0D662F5F88719F60892026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳坐到我附近，\n有什麼事的話，請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要來支援喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B357505230621196448FD1FF0C000A67094EC09EBC4E8B76848A71FF0C8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B389814F86652F63F45594300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她再沒多久就要到了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是我不知道該怎麼答，\n就請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳告訴我個好回答吧……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5979518D6C92591A4E455C31898152304E862026202600100001BE01000A8981662F62114E0D77E590538A72600E9EBC7B54FF0C000A5C318ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3544A8A346211500B597D56DE7B5454272026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "美好的咖啡館和扒手貓，\n如果還能聊得熱絡的話就太棒了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F8E597D7684549655619928548C6252624B8C93FF0C000A5982679C908480FD804A5F9771B17D6176848A715C31592A68D24E865462300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你的話，應該知道扒手貓\n是什麼寶可夢吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6076848A71FF0C61C98A7277E590536252624B8C93000A662F4EC09EBC5BF653EF59225427300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "壞心眼寶可夢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "58DE5FC3773C5BF653EF59220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冷酷寶可夢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B791775BF653EF59220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "威嚇寶可夢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A0156875BF653EF59220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒有錯！壞心眼\n完全就是在形容扒手貓啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C926709932FFF0158DE5FC3773C000A5B8C51685C31662F57285F625BB96252624B8C93554AFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是……這樣嗎？\n似乎不太像扒手貓耶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F2026202690196A2355CEFF1F000A4F3C4E4E4E0D592A50CF6252624B8C938036300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你應該也知道扒手貓\n為什麼會偷別人的東西對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6061C98A724E5F77E590536252624B8C93000A70BA4EC09EBC6703507752254EBA76846771897F5C0D5427300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了活下去",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E866D3B4E0B53BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了好玩",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E86597D73A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為討厭訓練家",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA8A0E53AD8A137DF45BB60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒有錯！只要和扒手貓在一起，\n就能享受到緊張刺激的每一天！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C926709932FFF0153EA8981548C6252624B8C9357284E008D77FF0C000A5C3180FD4EAB53D752307DCA5F35523A6FC076846BCF4E005929FF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是……這樣嗎？\n扒手貓不是更隨興一點的嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F2026202690196A2355CEFF1F000A6252624B8C934E0D662F66F496A882084E009EDE768455CEFF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你的話，應該知道扒手貓\n學不會什麼招式吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6076848A71FF0C61C98A7277E590536252624B8C93000A5B784E0D67034EC09EBC62DB5F0F5427300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "無理取鬧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7121740653D69B270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "詭計",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A6D8A080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欺詐",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B3A8A500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯沒錯！\n好像能學會但其實學不會，這才可愛呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932F6C92932FFF01000A597D50CF80FD5B7867034F4651765BE65B784E0D6703FF0C9019624D53EF611B5462FF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是……這樣嗎？\n扒手貓會用那個招式吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F2026202690196A2355CEFF1F000A6252624B8C936703752890A3500B62DB5F0F5427FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯哪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF54EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然和喜歡扒手貓的人聊天\n就會熱絡起來呢！真開心～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C7136548C559C6B616252624B8C9376844EBA804A5929000A5C31670371B17D618D774F865462FF01771F958B5FC3FF5EFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那個……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n扒手貓看來也很喜歡\n露夏妳……的樣子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A3500B2026202600100001BE01000A6252624B8C93770B4F864E5F5F88559C6B61000A9732590F59B32026202676846A235B50300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯哪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF54EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也聊得非常……愉快。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果妳不嫌棄，\n願意再和我見面……我會很開心。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F804A5F97975E5E382026202661095FEB300200100001BE01000A5982679C59B34E0D5ACC68C4FF0C000A9858610F518D548C6211898B976220262026621167035F88958B5FC3300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯～……你要靠聊扒手貓\n來炒熱氣氛的話，懂的好像不夠多呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那我就先告辭了～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF5E202620264F6089819760804A6252624B8C93000A4F86709271B16C236C1B76848A71FF0C61C27684597D50CF4E0D5920591A5462300200100001BE00000A90A362115C315148544A8FAD4E86FF5EFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "委託人的……\n眼前一片漆黑！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59D48A174EBA768420262026000A773C524D4E0072476F069ED1FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是說啊～！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n還想再聊聊扒手貓的事情嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8AAA554AFF5EFF0100100001BE01000A908460F3518D804A804A6252624B8C9376844E8B60C5561BFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯哪♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF54EA266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非……非常謝謝妳！\n那個……我稍微離開一下喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975E20262026975E5E388B1D8B1D59B3FF01000A90A3500B2026202662117A0D5FAE96E2958B4E004E0B5594300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
